intro=a.add('sections',2,'Imagine a classroom machine with an instruction card and a locked access key. The card can say which lesson-data version to use and how long an answer should be. The key grants privileged access and belongs on a protected path. If the data-version setting is missing, the machine can name the missing setting without displaying every value it can access. In this lesson both the settings and the private values are invented placeholders.')
