ref='Main scenario: missing DATA_VERSION triggers a debug dump of all environment values. Repair: validate declared required inputs at startup and report missing key names without values; do not substitute a public default secret. Mock contract: nonblank DATA_VERSION, exact positive integer MAX_WORDS, separate nonblank SIGNING_SECRET placeholder. Public ready record includes only status,data_version,maximum_words. Blocked record names missing/invalid keys without their values. Internal state may contain placeholder but must not be serialized into emitted records. Lab reads only supplied dicts, never real environment values, stores or accounts. Tests check both mock private values absent from chosen serialized records. Separate picture public maximum_words80 changes to60 while credential stays unchanged. This is a configured value, with no generated answer to prove length enforcement. Protected storage alone does not prove no leaks elsewhere, credential strength, rotation or deployed correctness.'
